{
  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1713883255_9686685_ce53c7db0a46b217d55a07a5b4208360.png",
  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Clix Flosser is a new an innovative way to improve your oral health and daily flossing habits.&nbsp;<span class=\"TextRun SCXW198880798 BCX2\" lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 20.5042px;\" xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW198880798 BCX2\">Discover a smarter way to care for your smile with Clix Flosser, the innovative solution designed to transform your oral hygiene routine. Flossing no longer needs to be a chore; it can be a breeze with Clix Flosser's unique features.</span></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW198880798 BCX2\" lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 20.5042px;\" xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW198880798 BCX2\">Check us out at Clixflosser.com for more information!</span></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW198880798 BCX2\" lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 20.5042px; font-family: Calibri, 'Calibri_EmbeddedFont', 'Calibri_MSFontService', sans-serif;\" xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW198880798 BCX2\"><strong>Effortless Flossing at Your Fingertips:</strong> The Clix Wheel mechanism, where fresh floss is just a click away. Say goodbye to manual threading and tangles. Enjoy the simplicity of a hygienic, one-click floss dispensing system that's ready when you are.</span></span></p>\r\n<p><span class=\"TextRun SCXW198880798 BCX2\" lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 20.5042px; font-family: Calibri, 'Calibri_EmbeddedFont', 'Calibri_MSFontService', sans-serif;\" xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span c